<%- include('partials/header') %><main class="page-main"><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="section-kicker">Our story</span><h1>Nature, memory & handmade detail</h1><p><%= site.about_text %></p></div></section><section class="section container about-grid"><div><span class="section-kicker">Shilptara by Sonali</span><h2>Made to keep meaningful things close</h2><p>Our collection brings together preserved botanicals, resin, jewellery findings and personalised details. From a tiny flower inside a pendant to a wedding varmala preserved in a frame, the idea is simple: turn moments into objects you can keep.</p><p>Every handmade piece naturally varies in colour, texture and placement. Those small differences are not flaws. They are part of the character of working with real flowers and hand-finished materials.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/shop">Explore the Collection</a></div><div class="about-values"><article><b>01</b><h3>Botanical at heart</h3><p>Flowers, petals, leaves and nature-inspired forms guide the collection.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h3>Personal by design</h3><p>Names, dates, initials and memory flowers can be added to many pieces.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h3>Handmade in small batches</h3><p>Each piece is assembled and finished carefully rather than mass-produced.</p></article></div></section></main><%- include('partials/footer') %>
